WEBVTT

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:07.390
Beating out the competition: SoLaMi Dressing!

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:10.900
These wonderful Paradise Shoes go to these six!

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.910
Thank you, everyone!

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:21.230
Please give another big round of applause for PriPara's most brilliant rising stars, SoLaMi Dressing!

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:29.340
Now, I'm sure you all can't wait for the drawing of the contest day for the second article!

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.800
Wow, a lottery? I'll do it! I've got great luck with these!

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.260
This one... And this!

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.280
31st of December!

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:41.850
What?

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.530
So soon-pri?

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.060
Are you quite serious?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.200
You're the worst, Lala!

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.320
And the prize will be the Paradise Tiara!

00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:01.620
Incidentally, this event's winners qualify for the next one automatically!

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.650
What?

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:06.960
So the six of us are participating together again-pri?

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.870
Precisely! And if you win again, the Shoes and Tiara both belong to every one of you.

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:17.880
But if you lose, the new winner will claim your shoes as well.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:18.930
Whaaat?!

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:24.440
So you all can look forward to more SoLaMi Dressing in the second ParaPri event!

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:33.740
All right! It'll be a cinch for the six of us to "gotcha" that Tiara-pri!

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:33.830
Capisce!

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:35.520
Let's go!
Capisce!

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:35.540
Let's go!

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.670
Oh, good day!

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:23.690
Quite.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:26.040
You're headed to PriPara as well?

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:29.630
Yes. You're not with Lala's mother?

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:35.150
Hime—She is too busy at the restaurant today.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.600
PriPara Change Complete-pri!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:01.810
Wowie! You girls look stunning today-pri!

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:04.160
You're looking quite smart yourself-glo!

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.120
Thanks-pri!

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.260
Gloglo!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.630
This PhotoTicket came out great!

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.440
Lala!

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:16.160
Eiko!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.880
Hello!

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.500
You're Lala's friend?

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.610
Yes, I'm Nao.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.950
I'm Eiko. Nice to meet you!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:28.340
Your Christmas show yesterday was the best!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.920
Congrats on winning!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:30.990
Congrats!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:32.160
Thanks!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.970
Whoa! It's Lala!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:34.970
Sure is!

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:35.880
What?

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.410
She's so cute!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.200
Do your thing!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.710
Will you shake my hand?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.780
Capisce!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.800
Thanks for your support!

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:49.350
What is it?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.220
It felt like someone was staring at me.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.750
Just my imagination?

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.400
I can smell it-glo.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:02.940
The stench of children who didn't finish homework before PriPara-glo.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.260
Gulp!

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.660
Y-You're here too, Headmistress?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:10.690
I shall take care of your PriTickets while you finish homework-glo.

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:11.370
Ehh!?

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:16.830
I don't even care if you're from Paprika or not anymore-glo!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.530
Hold on-glo!

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:20.450
Nao! This way!

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:21.560
Right!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.000
This way!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.850
I heard they made a new area around here.

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.800
This place is huge! Look at all these trees!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.910
Amazing! They even have a lake!

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.180
And fancy boats!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.560
Oh, you getting on?

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.930
Can we? We're saved!

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.110
Let's get on, Nao!

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.050
Right!

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.900
Hold on you! You'll never get away-gloglo!

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.890
Headmistress!

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.070
Rina!

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:57.600
It's Mr. Meganii!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.010
Are you all right, miss?

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.880
Err... Yes, yes, I'm fine!

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:06.760
I'm relieved.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.020
Uh, yes...

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:10.090
My, but you are beautiful.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:10.850
Eh?

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.800
I-I'm nothing of the sort... Glo...

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.890
Never have I seen another quite like you.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.420
A new kind of glamour, seen in no PriPara idol before.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.310
Glo!

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.770
Someone like you...

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:30.010
I feel a wind of change will come to PriPara in your wake.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:34.820
Meganii, my lord...

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:40.180
A sea lion am I,

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:40.590
PriPara really is tons of fun.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:43.310
not a furry seal...

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:46.870
Everywhere is so trendy and cute and shiny!

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.840
You gonna start performing?

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.530
Maybe a bit later on...

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:56.060
I have no idea how to dance, so I need tons of practice...

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:59.060
I might even find a little time to support you.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.560
What, only a little?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.960
Just kidding!

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.390
We finally made a trade!

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.230
Yeah, this is awesome!

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:20.290
Bye bye! See you on New Year's Eve!

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:21.810
Capisce!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.920
Capisce.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.280
Oh, Falulu!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.380
Capisce.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:33.540
You're imitating me?

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:37.580
Capisce! Capisce! Capisce! How was that?

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.150
R-Really good!

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:44.060
You seem a bit more grownup than before.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:48.440
Yes. I studied many things after "Capisce!"

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.930
Studied?

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:53.970
Hey, Lala, why do you have so many fans?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:56.030
Was that girl you were with a fan?

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:59.490
Falulu? You've been following me?

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:03.250
Falulu wants fans like Lala has. Teach me.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.950
Teach you, huh... Um...

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.710
Oh, Lala!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:12.170
Would you like to come to our store?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:12.930
What?

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.060
It'd do for some great publicity for us if you did.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:22.640
PriSnap Fortunes? This is the store?

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.860
This is way too accurate!

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:29.340
No one's ever noticed Leona's a boy so fast.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:31.240
Tension Surprise Max!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.320
Relax!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.280
"You were a jellyfish in your past life."

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:42.790
Amazing! I'll have to ask if I'm going to win the next ParaPri or not!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.180
Hold it right there!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.670
You don't need a fortune teller with my calculations.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.960
And I can already see the conclusion clearly.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:54.660
No! I want my fortune told!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:55.740
Unscientific.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:56.470
Incomprehensible.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:59.840
Geez! Falulu, let's go get our fortunes told!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.140
Hello?

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.050
Step right in.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.180
Welcome to Nyaru's humble manor.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.110
What shall I divine for you?

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:14.070
Falulu wants fans.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:18.860
I see... Let's see what the cards say then.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:22.890
Pick whichever PriTicket you want.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:34.880
This is... the power to rule the world!

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.800
Roll the world?

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.890
Not <i>roll</i> the world! <i>Rule</i> the world!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.230
A new world order!

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:49.440
A... new world order?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.070
Bad girl, Falulu!

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.690
You ran off on your own again!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.880
Unicorn?

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:57.740
This is an important time for you, Falulu.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.510
Get your act together.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.920
Wait, Falulu!

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:04.700
You should come see the New Year's Eve ParaPri!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.160
Come on, hurry up!

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.870
We're so busy today...

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:12.190
I wonder if she'll be there.

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.070
Here we are at last!

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:29.490
One last party before welcoming the new year!

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:32.570
The Paradise Tiara Prize Event is open!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.280
Who will claim the tiara?

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.580
It's ours!

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:40.990
Yeah!

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:45.170
I'll steal the spotlight again! Tension Super Duper Max!

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.210
Relax.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:49.620
The six of us together are unbeatable. Live and let live!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.840
I'm confident we'll do even better than last time!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:53.680
Capisce!

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:54.380
Yes.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:58.550
Wow! Everyone's even better than last time!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.860
But they can't beat Lala's team.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:02.760
Yeah!

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:08.540
And now, last time's winner: SoLaMi Dressing!

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:10.810
It's time-usa.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:15.260
And the lead manager is here to see the moment of victory-kuma!

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.940
I'm the leader-usa!

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.160
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.870
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:36.220
Coord Change Start!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:44.780
SoLaMi Smile is using the Idol Coord with its refreshing blue gingham pattern.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:51.910
The layered frills of the skirt are very girly.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:59.340
And the highlights of silver look fabulous.

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:02.030
Wish Ribbon Idol Coord!

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:03.850
Pri!

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:09.080
Dressing Pafé's has the same gingham pattern,

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:12.250
but with a more mature look in purple.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:18.480
An original combination of a uniquely shaped skirt and shorts.

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:25.500
Not to forget the gorgeous gold highlights.

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:28.600
Nocturne Sky Idol Coord!

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:29.550
Go!

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:30.410
Yay!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:51.930
Making Drama Switch On!

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:57.550
Pshu...

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:02.270
Go.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.540
Gotta get up early tomorrow!

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:06.990
There!

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:08.210
Pri!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:09.110
Take that!

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:10.770
Eat this!

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:12.620
Pshu...

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:19.630
Let's have some fun! At PriPara Hills!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.500
Good night.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.950
Cyalume Change!

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.740
Amazing!

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:20.980
Chanko!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.690
All right!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.070
Huge success!

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:25.600
Victory-pri!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:31.260
Excuse me, but we actually have a last minute entry.

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.120
So we have one more show to go!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:33.990
Huh?

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.830
What's with that? No one told me!

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:46.620
And would you believe it, this is her stage debut!

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:58.200
I'm Falulu. Pleased to meet you all.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.520
Capisce.

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.310
Falulu's so cute!

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:02.240
She's parodying Lala!

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:03.480
Respect!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:35.860
Making Drama Switch On!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.050
Believe...

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:46.370
in dreams.

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:54.130
Frozen Castle

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:08.400
Mirage!

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:12.430
Cyalume Change!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.000
Falulu!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.230
I love you!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.050
Usa...

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:57.340
That's a full-on Prism Voice.

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:59.430
It's perfected to such an extent-kuma.

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:01.470
Prism Voice?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:07.770
Holy moly! I've never seen a show like this!

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:11.880
Her voice was so amazing I couldn't even move!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.420
You're the best Falulu!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:14.940
Lovely stuff, Falulu!

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.840
Our Lady Falulu!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.270
Falulu's the cutest!

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.870
You're so cute, Falulu!

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:23.950
And our winner is: Falulu! With a huge margin.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:29.270
And her rank goes from PriPara Debut right to Near Breakthrough.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.970
N-No way!

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.230
Impossible... Uh... It's...

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.700
It's definitely unfair to enter at the last minute-usa!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:44.200
You got a problem with my Falulu, punk?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.160
Huh? Who're you?

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.880
I haven't seen these ears at the monthly mascot gatherings-usa.

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:54.190
Stop showing off, newbie!

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:56.380
Here's my introduction.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:57.880
Hmm?

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:02.110
Julius Mpampis Adamantios Nikolapouloulou

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:06.060
Anaxagolas Odysseus Procopius Tondol-Zlatkova

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:08.320
Nikodemos Metrophanes Caesar

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:11.480
Yorgos Sebastianos Paraskevas Zenon Parthenova

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:14.860
Krysanthe Akhnasia Euterpe Harmonia Demetrian!?

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:16.950
You win...

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:18.570
Seems we're all in agreement.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:22.640
<i>Just what is a Prism Voice?</i>

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:27.740
Please give Falulu another big round of applause!

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:33.700
Falulu has lots of fans.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.170
Capisce!

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.080
Falulu...

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.720
My numbers have never been this off.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:51.690
This sucks! Me and Leona are much cuter!

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:55.230
But that show really was incredible.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:59.760
Pride goes before destruction! That encapsulates the reason for our loss.

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:03.240
As such, we are left with but one choice!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.820
Right you are.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.200
It was a lot of fun performing with everyone together, but...

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:10.660
The party is over.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:16.120
Next ParaPri will see SoLaMi Smile win and reclaim the Coord from Falulu.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:20.740
Nay! Dressing Pafé will claim victory once more!

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:21.460
And...

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.640
Happy New Year!

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:29.170
Go!

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:29.880
Chanko!

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:30.370
Go!

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:31.100
Chanko!

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:31.600
Go!

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:34.630
Chanko!

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:09.100
Hi everyone! Happy new...

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:14.360
Why'd I have to get a cold on New Year's Day?

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:15.290
Capisce.

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:16.320
Falulu!

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:19.290
Can Falulu have Lala's "Capisce"?

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.770
No way! Capisce is <i>my</i> thing!

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:23.210
Capisce!

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:24.420
Seriously, I jus...

00:23:27.450 --> 00:23:29.730
This year isn't starting out easy.

00:23:29.730 --> 00:23:32.300
Next time: Happy New Year Capisce!
